Package: nexus-audio
Version: 2.4.1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 22220
Maintainer: Jason Jordan <jasjordan@proton.me>
Homepage: https://github.com/jasjordan/NexusAudio
Depends: libasound2 | libasound2t64, libc6, libgcc-s1
Recommends: libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libxcb1, libgl1
Description: NEXUS//AUDIO - retro terminal music and audiobook player
 Linux-first music & audiobook player with a retro CRT-terminal UI.
 Supports MP3, FLAC, OGG/Vorbis, AAC, ALAC, WAV, and ISO MP4 audio via
 Symphonia, with cpal-based playback and MPRIS media-key integration.
